'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml

title Viewing one day from the latest plan
participant ":MishMash" as App
participant ":ViewPlanCommand" as View
participant "mealPlanSource:\nSupplier" as Meals
participant "targetsSource:\nSupplier" as Targets
participant ":MealPlanViewer" as Viewer
App -> View : execute(book)
activate View
View -> Meals : get()
activate Meals
Meals --> View : mealsByDay
deactivate Meals
note right of View
  Nonempty plan; check the
  selected day against its size.
end note
View -> Targets : get()
activate Targets
Targets --> View : plan targets
deactivate Targets
View -> Viewer : view(mealsByDay,\ndayNumber, targets)
activate Viewer
Viewer --> View : formatted day
deactivate Viewer
View --> App : feedback
deactivate View

@enduml
'@@author
